#
# NexoraOS — package list for the live ISO (x86_64)
# -----------------------------------------------
# ONLY official repo packages (core/extra/multilib) belong here.
# AUR-only packages (calamares, yay, neofetch, arc-gtk-theme, etc.) are
# installable post-boot via Nexora Store or our bundled AUR helper.
#
# This list has been verified against the Arch repo state as of 2026-08.
#

